{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01156",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 4.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.09,
      "end_seconds": 9.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.89,
      "end_seconds": 14.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a high fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.21,
      "end_seconds": 16.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.67,
      "end_seconds": 31.07,
      "duration_seconds": 13.4,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the the month before, I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.23,
      "end_seconds": 37.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.72,
      "end_seconds": 43.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "it happens once or twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.01,
      "end_seconds": 49.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "what about pain much worse than it looks, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.02,
      "end_seconds": 64.07,
      "duration_seconds": 14.05,
      "text": "yes, I have i've also had a red hot swelling on my leg, for about two weeks as for red hot swelling on my leg, I'd say on and off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.77,
      "end_seconds": 67.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Any dark blisters as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.76,
      "end_seconds": 68.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.7,
      "end_seconds": 73.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Have you had any cut or insect bite?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.65,
      "end_seconds": 79.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "No cut or insect bite, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.4,
      "end_seconds": 85.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Okay, any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.42,
      "end_seconds": 88.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.71,
      "end_seconds": 103.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.17,
      "end_seconds": 108.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.26,
      "end_seconds": 111.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.06,
      "end_seconds": 117.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Yes, depression. I have gout, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.36,
      "end_seconds": 124.04,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Okay, I can see diabetes in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.82,
      "end_seconds": 138.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.13,
      "end_seconds": 144.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.79,
      "end_seconds": 147.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.99,
      "end_seconds": 152.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.6,
      "end_seconds": 158.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.33,
      "end_seconds": 164.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.7,
      "end_seconds": 166.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "alright, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.44,
      "end_seconds": 170.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.28,
      "end_seconds": 178.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.86,
      "end_seconds": 182.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Trimethoprim. I come out in... well, itching."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.96,
      "end_seconds": 190.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.72,
      "end_seconds": 197.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer. My grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.58,
      "end_seconds": 215.1,
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.49,
      "end_seconds": 221.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "I'm on sertraline, 50 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 222.28,
      "end_seconds": 227.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Doctor, our chart from the last visit lists it as 25 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.53,
      "end_seconds": 231.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.93,
      "end_seconds": 239.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I take febuxostat, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.24,
      "end_seconds": 243.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.09,
      "end_seconds": 251.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "80 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.29,
      "end_seconds": 256.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.81,
      "end_seconds": 261.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 262.79,
      "end_seconds": 272.47,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Temperature is 39.0 degrees, blood pressure 105 over 67, pulse is 98 beats a minute, saturation 95 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.5,
      "end_seconds": 274.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.64,
      "end_seconds": 281.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.01,
      "end_seconds": 284.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.89,
      "end_seconds": 303.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "The skin on your leg is dusky with blisters and is very tender, and you are feverish."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.64,
      "end_seconds": 324.72,
      "duration_seconds": 18.08,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. We shouldn't forget severe cellulitis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.9,
      "end_seconds": 329.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.76,
      "end_seconds": 351.16,
      "duration_seconds": 20.4,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review, but I'd like to confirm. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had a high fever, and no cut or insect bite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.95,
      "end_seconds": 354.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "that's it, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.7,
      "end_seconds": 378.95,
      "duration_seconds": 22.25,
      "text": "Let's get urgent blood tests, for severe skin infection. I think an urgent surgical review makes sense here, for possible necrotising infection. I am sending you to hospital now, do not wait. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 380.44,
      "end_seconds": 382.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "okay, makes sense"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 383.27,
      "end_seconds": 389.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again straight away. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 389.99,
      "end_seconds": 393.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 394.48,
      "end_seconds": 396.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}